"Someone has requested a password reset for the following account:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Site name:</strong> %1$s\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>User name:</strong> %2$s\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tTo reset your password, please click on the <a href=\"%3$s\">"
